# The public site. Nothing here is a scratch space - every tracked file is served.
#
# Added 2026-08-04 after `git add -A projects/nexus` committed six backup files
# to the live site in commit 0fd2040. This repository had no .gitignore, so the
# sweep took every working copy lying in the tree.

# Editor / OS
.DS_Store
*.swp

# Backups and pre-change copies - these are working artefacts, never published
*.bak
*.bak.*
*.orig
*.before_*
*.before-*
*_before_*
*.stage*.bak
backups/
**/backups/
